Package: syslogd-rs
Version: 0.1.0
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: syslogd-rs maintainers
Depends: bsdutils
Conflicts: rsyslog, syslog-ng, sysklogd, inetutils-syslogd
Description: memory-safe rsyslog-compatible syslog daemon
 A Linux syslog daemon in Rust. It parses a documented subset of
 rsyslog.conf, receives systemd journal messages, kernel messages
 and network syslog (UDP/TCP/TLS), and routes them with the same
 rule semantics as rsyslogd. Strict checking: unsupported config
 constructs fail closed instead of silently dropping rules.
